## Customized Managed Tables

Tables installed by Microsoft or ISV managed solutions that the project customized. Only the project's columns, forms and views are listed.
{{ for t in customized_tables }}{{ render_table t (t.IsCustomEntity ? "" : " *(standard)*") }}{{ end }}
{{- if solution_only_tables.size > 0 }}

**Also in project solutions** — no project columns, forms or views; typically there for a relationship, a ribbon or as a dependency: {{ solution_only_tables | array.join ", " }}
{{- end }}

